  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3e8b0496d4a0e4e660fec6a4fe40e5eead8e38b2_0.webp\" alt=\"Связанная текстура Mizuno\">Связанная текстурная паковка для Mizuno Craft16.</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1221053/description_1c4f3742-2d0e-40aa-86d6-e1e61f46125d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"307\" height=\"213\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1221053/description_51e1de8d-6aa2-41e7-8218-a274b7e7a150.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"210\"></p><p><strong>Требования:</strong></p><blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontinuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a> или <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></p>\n<del><strong>Больше не поддерживается </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Неофициальные Mizuno's</a></strong></del></blockquote><blockquote><strong>Версия 2.4 Вы можете объединить&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/modern-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Mizuno's</a> и <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizunos-tinker-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's | Tinker Edition</a></strong></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Все мои дополнения к Mizuno.<br></strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" tar